4.9 SHORT DEFENSE SUMMARY (IMPLEMENTATION)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In implementation terms, this FYP is a complete full-stack arbitrage platform:
- multi-exchange data ingestion,
- multi-gate safe execution,
- AI-assisted reasoning,
- persistent trade auditing,
- and real-time operator dashboard.

The implementation directly operationalizes the proposed methodology rather than
remaining at conceptual level.

